      "writtenOn": "2026-06-23T15:54:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this opens a can of worms in terms of policy. Do we get rid of the old handler, or do we have to chain all of them together. Since in practice this is a singleton for our interaction, a client could implement a SkLogHandlerListener that they collect and call into in their handler impl.",
