        "id": 11964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-01T18:28:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think Noelle and I talked about Android\u0027s use cases offline and decided that we could have most use cases covered by the call-once singleton model. Marking done, but reopen if I misremembered.",
      "parentUuid": "d12fbd8f_f81c0ade",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 31,
