      "writtenOn": "2026-06-18T17:29:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could this be a `shared_ptr\u003cSkLogHandler\u003e`? or a `unique_ptr\u003cSkLogHandler\u003e` if we need to enforce the ownership transfer?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 36,
