      "writtenOn": "2026-06-23T15:54:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s best practice to avoid `shared_ptr`, it has dragons. It could be `unique_ptr`, although this is inheriting the conventions that we have in `SkEventTracer`.",
      "parentUuid": "07485b34_041ed433",
      "range": {
