        "id": 11964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-01T18:28:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think long term goal is that the handler should be enough, so I\u0027d like to move all clients to that model instead. But for now I think a comment will suffice for now to dissuade further overrides.",
      "parentUuid": "1f0f0f9f_98d8f322",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
